      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present the postmodification of a diamondoid 3D supramolecular organic framework (SOF) to append [Ru(BPY)3]2+ groups through the formation of a hydrazone bond. The resulting SOF works as an efficient recyclable heterogeneous catalyst for visible-light-induced reduction of aromatic azides to amines."},
